        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Choosing between an SGLT2 inhibitor and a GLP-1 receptor agonist for type 2 diabetes depends on your specific health profile, as modern guidelines prioritize individual organ protection and weight goals over a one-size-fits-all approach. While metformin remains a foundational choice, both SGLT2 inhibitors and GLP-1 agonists are recommended as first-line or early options depending on underlying conditions like heart disease, kidney disease, or obesity .",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "both SGLT2 inhibitors and GLP-1 agonists are recommended as first-line or early options depending on underlying conditions like heart disease, kidney disease, or obesity"
